# Local values for `wrangler pages dev` (Cloudflare Pages Functions).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in your real values. Never commit `.dev.vars`.

# --- Production / recommended: Brevo HTTPS API ---------------------------
# Cloudflare's servers can't reach SMTP servers, so production must use this.
BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib-your-key

# Sender shown to clients (verified sender in Brevo, routed to Gmail by Cloudflare Email Routing)
MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=stay@mymarrakechtrip.com
MAIL_FROM_NAME="STAY by My Marrakech Trip"

# Where enquiries are delivered (comma-separate for multiple inboxes)
ADMIN_EMAIL=mymarrakechtrip36@gmail.com
ADMIN_NAME="STAY by My Marrakech Trip"

SITE_URL=https://stay.mymarrakechtrip.com
WHATSAPP_NUMBER=212771444668
# Optional, defaults to ${SITE_URL}/email/stay-logo.png
# LOGO_URL=https://stay.mymarrakechtrip.com/email/stay-logo.png

# --- Optional: SMTP via Nodemailer (local testing only, used when BREVO_API_KEY is empty) ---
# MAIL_HOST=smtp-relay.brevo.com
# MAIL_PORT=587
# MAIL_ENCRYPTION=tls
# MAIL_USERNAME=your-brevo-smtp-login
# MAIL_PASSWORD=your-brevo-smtp-key
